  "description": "<i>Cyberpunk: Edgerunners 2</i> pulls you back into Night City, where lives become entangled to the extreme. Weak, a washed-up cyberpunk legend, is now forced to live without chrome as he searches for a sense of purpose in a world that’s passed him by. Meanwhile, the deadly nomad D sets out on a path to revenge that brings him close to corpo secrets never meant to be found. Across this ten-episode standalone series, uncover a story of family, obsession, legacy — and how your lens reflects the stories of the people around you..<br><br>\n\nWhen the world is blinded by spectacle, what extremes do you have to go to make your story matter?<br><br>\n(Source: Cyberpunk: Edgerunners 2 Official Site, Official Twitter)",
